<!DOCTYPE component>
<import src="../components/back-button.heml" as="back-button"/>
<properties>

</properties>
<component>
    <div id="outermost-container">
        <back-button/>
        <h1>Who Am I?</h1>
        <p>
            My name is Onur Altintas. But you can call me Gus Fring <span class="alt-text"><br />And don't worry Im not a DEA agent.</span>
            <br />
            <br />
        <p class="text-block" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
            I born in Turkey and came to the Netherlands in 2020, when my father got an job offering from a dutch
            company. I haven't been planning to move to here before that sudden offer to my dad actually. In my first
            two years here, I have learned dutch on a language school to be able to comprehend words such as
            <code>Elektriciteitsproductiemaatschappij</code> or <code>Hottentottententententoonstellingsterrein</code>.
            <br /><br />
            Afterward I started my 4<span class="alt-text">(3)</span> years education on an dutch school called Scalda.
            I graduated from Software Development program of Scalda. Which was good but not what I would prefer to do in
            the future as someone in the IT world.
            <br /><br />
            It revolved too much around web development, agile working disciplin, client communication etc. I don't want
            to build a commercial webapp for my client using <code>HashSet</code> for example, I want to be the one to
            research and build that <code>HashSet</code>.
            <br />
            <span class="alt-text">"I'm the one who Codes Sklyer." <br />~Some Wise & Bald guy</span>
        </p>
        My hobbies are:
        <ol style="text-align: left;" class="styled-list">
            <li>
                Playing games (Mostly souls likes, Dark Souls III is my favorite game of all time.)
            </li>
            <li>
                Reading western fiction, manga and informative books.
            </li>
            <li>
                Watching anime, western series and Breaking Bad
                <br />
                <span class="alt-text">yes breaking bad needs its own category of fiction.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                Coding on my free time with my own free will.
            </li>
        </ol>
        </p>
    </div>
</component>